[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 541.43, "timestamp": "00:09:01", "text": "（笑い）は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 545.91, "timestamp": "00:09:05", "text": "正しかった。 ああ、こんにちは、先生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 548.79, "timestamp": "00:09:08", "text": "PCのスペックと言ったんです。 ああ、私の配信用PC。 しかし、私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 551.43, "timestamp": "00:09:11", "text": "ゲーム用PCが壊れてしまった。 ええと、単一のPC"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 555.11, "timestamp": "00:09:15", "text": "環境での話です。 えっと、えーと、私の基本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 558.63, "timestamp": "00:09:18", "text": "スペックって何でしたっけ？ えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 561.43, "timestamp": "00:09:21", "text": "YouTubeかTwitchで感嘆符のスペックをやれば手に入ると思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 564.07, "timestamp": "00:09:24", "text": "。 それは、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 568.424, "timestamp": "00:09:28", "author": "@kurunekodream", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/RLzqgZjl8ILhIIU27ghgxtcyxaMDaQ4nJQ8GzPmDKVVI7HHPJUZsDQV_Itc49vlXGx8THQhiP90=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "!specs"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 571.254, "timestamp": "00:09:31", "author": "@Fossabot", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Qae0Khsat_K9w3KLI_TUx-usVsmpNVDdoSaJjJqkO8yeQsjDwP1oZiwJ8s2cjd_lZ5HnnDuQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You can check out Joq's whole setup on https://kit.co/joqnix"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 574.389, "timestamp": "00:09:34", "text": "Ryzen 5 5600X と 166 のようなものだ。GPU が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 579.215, "timestamp": "00:09:39", "author": "@nightbot", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kDRQPhJSlRLHo_-DXQg2a4b4X-P-Qgl6np58QME0EV8lw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You can check out Joq's whole setup on https://kit.co/joqnix"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 583.67, "timestamp": "00:09:43", "text": "ええ、kit.coのリンクですね。 はい。 はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 586.23, "timestamp": "00:09:46", "text": "ストリーミングPCのセクションを確認してみてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.43, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "ゲーミングPCが壊れても、どうでもいいことだ。 ええと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 592.116, "timestamp": "00:09:52", "text": "そうですね、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 594.23, "timestamp": "00:09:54", "text": "[咳払い] それから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.47, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "TwitchとYouTubeで24時間365日配信のチャンネルを開設しました。 えっと、"}]